                                                "sense_id": "536f823d-64e2-314a-93ad-2affd000b49f",
                                                "text": "Russia signalled on Monday it would backstop the European Union's bailout of Cyprus despite anger that the weekend rescue deal would impose heavy losses on uninsured depositors, many of them Russian."
